<title>JAPAN: Acom to buy back up to 14.66 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Acom to buy back up to 14.66 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Acom Co Ltd, a major consumer financing company, said on Tuesday that it would change its company regulations to allow it to buy back up to 14.66 million of its own shares.  </p>
<p>Acom's annual shareholder meeting on June 27 approved the decision to change the regulations, Acom said.</p>
